{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":27,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列必蒙拯救"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["到那日，耶和华必用祂无坚不摧的利剑惩罚海怪，那蜿蜒、快速爬行的蛇。祂必杀死那海中的怪物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"到那日，你们要歌颂那佳美的葡萄园。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我耶和华是看守它的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我勤加浇灌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"昼夜守护，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不让人毁坏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不再发怒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若是发现荆棘和蒺藜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就对付它们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把它们烧光，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除非它们寻求我的庇护，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要与我和好，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要与我和好。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"将来，雅各必扎根生长，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列必发芽开花，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"果实遍地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华岂像击打以色列的敌人那样击打以色列人？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂岂像杀戮以色列的敌人那样杀戮以色列人？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂与以色列人为敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们被掳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂驱逐他们离开本地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在刮东风的日子，用暴风吹散他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各家的罪恶必借此得到赦免，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们罪恶被除掉后的硕果是：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把一切祭坛的石头打得粉碎，如同石灰粉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"推倒亚舍拉神像和香坛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坚城荒凉，居所被遗弃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同旷野一样杳无人烟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牛犊在那里吃草、躺卧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃光树枝上的叶子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"树枝枯干断落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"妇女拿去作柴烧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这是愚昧无知的民族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以他们的创造主必不怜悯他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不向他们施恩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["以色列人啊，到那日，耶和华必从幼发拉底河到埃及小河把你们一个个召集起来，像打树拾果子一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["到那日，号角大响后，亚述地将要灭亡的以色列人和流亡到埃及的以色列人，都必来到耶路撒冷的圣山敬拜耶和华。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/27.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/28.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/26.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}